stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 750 Td
(KYC Document Requirements) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Apex Global Bank - Customer Onboarding) Tj T*
(Document ID: POL-KYC-001 | Version 5.2 | Owner: Onboarding and Compliance) Tj T*
(Illustrative policy for the Finova demo workspace. Not legal or regulatory advice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This policy lists the documents required to verify the identity and address of every customer) Tj T*
(before an account is opened, and the schedule for periodic re-verification \(re-KYC\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Individual Customers) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(One proof of identity AND one proof of address are required.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Accepted proof of identity:) Tj T*
(- PAN card \(mandatory for all accounts\)) Tj T*
(- Aadhaar card \(with masked number\) or e-KYC via Aadhaar OTP) Tj T*
(- Passport) Tj T*
(- Voter ID card) Tj T*
(- Driving licence) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Accepted proof of address \(must be dated within the last 3 months if a utility bill\):) Tj T*
(- Aadhaar card or passport showing current address) Tj T*
(- Utility bill \(electricity, water, gas, landline\)) Tj T*
(- Registered rent agreement) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A recent photograph and a live video-KYC session or in-person verification complete the) Tj T*
(process.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Institutional and Corporate Customers) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Institutional accounts require all of the following:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Certificate of Incorporation and Memorandum and Articles of Association.) Tj T*
(2. Company PAN and GST registration certificate.) Tj T*
(3. Board resolution authorising the account opening and naming authorised signatories.) Tj T*
(4. KYC documents \(Section 2\) for every authorised signatory.) Tj T*
(5. Beneficial ownership declaration identifying every person holding 10 percent or more) Tj T*
(ownership or control.) Tj T*
(6. Audited financial statements for the last 2 years.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Risk Tiers and Re-KYC Schedule) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Low risk \(salaried individuals, standard tier\): re-KYC every 10 years.) Tj T*
(- Medium risk: re-KYC every 8 years.) Tj T*
(- High risk \(PEPs, high-value private wealth tiers, cross-border businesses\): re-KYC every 2) Tj T*
(years, with enhanced due diligence including source of funds.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Verification Status) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Pending: documents submitted, awaiting verification \(target 2 business days\).) Tj T*
(- Under Review: discrepancy found; customer contacted for clarification.) Tj T*
(- Verified: all checks passed.) Tj T*
(- Rejected: documents invalid or forged. Forged documents are reported to Compliance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Accounts with KYC still Pending after 30 days are restricted to credits only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
